    {
      "id": "change-names",
      "rule": "N-3",
      "reason": "plan N-3, N-1: a library of a data format is named after the format, so the repository is json; design P-1 and E-2 give its package, module and error class names: Composer polyspec/json, PHP Polyspec\\Json, PyPI polyspec-json, Python polyspec.json, npm @polyspec/json, Go module github.com/polyspec/json/packages/go, PHP extension polyspec_json, the error classes Json<Category>Error in PHP, Node and WASM and JSON<Category>Error in Python (N-2: an acronym word is one capital word in PHP and Node and all capitals in Python and Go)",
      "symbol": "polyspec/ordered-json, Polyspec\\OrderedJson, polyspec-ordered-json, polyspec.ordered_json, @polyspec/ordered-json",
      "from": {
        "php": "Composer polyspec/ordered-json, namespace Polyspec\\OrderedJson, extension polyspec_ordered_json",
